                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "If I had to grade this game, it gets a D+. I actually like that there's a puzzle element, but the puzzles are nonsensical. The whole beginning of the game just involves finding a banana so the main character can go to bed. Then you end up being stalked by a barrel in a smiley face, and end up in a lab with silent hill type creatures. Then you go back, and the game ends. It is utterly pointless but kind of \"so bad it's good\" I liked that there were at least puzzles and things to figure out, so I recommend it for that reason alone.",
